title: Implement event-to-hook matching with tool matchers
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:22:26Z"
---
Match incoming events against configured hooks. Support regex matchers on tool_name (e.g. 'Bash|Write|Edit'). Support matchers on other fields where applicable (e.g. PreCompact matcher: manual/auto). Return list of matching hooks to execute.